  <section>
    <h2>Behaviour in Amstelvar Avar2</h2>
    <p>
      Amstelvar Avar2 uses YTOS to control vertical overshoot. The
      transformation changes how far round and pointed forms extend
      beyond their alignment zones while preserving their relationship to the
      baseline, x-height, cap height, and other vertical measures.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Uppercase round construction — O</h2>
    <p>
      O is the primary round control. YTOS changes how far its top and bottom
      extend beyond the cap-height and baseline alignment zones.
    </p>

{% set specimenAxis = "YTOS" %}
